# tally 2.1.8 R5 (#162's rest, pick P29; T's m2/g1/bands_b): zc's patch in a2 finds no table in force under the cut
# 2026-02-15 that c_patch_alone writes (a3, zc's base, is known 2026-03-01), which load sees: LOAD-REPLACE at load,
# in the words run gave it. A guard: refcore printed it as a load refusal whatever the asks before (through
# LoadAtRun), so this test passes on the commit before; the check now sits at load.
=== m.tally
model bd
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "synthetic"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

band za(x: money PLN): num
band zb(x: money PLN): num
band zc(x: money PLN): num

ask a_whole_alone: za(60.00 PLN) law 2026-09-15
ask a_whole_over: za(60.00 PLN) law 2026-03-15
ask b_patch: zb(60.00 PLN) law 2026-03-15
ask c_patch_alone: zc(60.00 PLN) law 2026-03-15 as known 2026-02-15
ask c_patch_late: zc(60.00 PLN) law 2026-03-15

version a1
  cite s
  governs 2026-01..2026-06
  known 2026-01-01
  za: [0, 50) = 1 "a"
  za: [50, inf) = 2 "a"
  zb: [0, 50) = 1 "a"
  zb: [50, inf) = 2 "a"

version a2
  cite s
  governs 2026-01..2026-12
  known 2026-02-01
  replace za: [0, 100) = 3 "whole"
  replace za: [100, inf) = 4 "whole"
  replace zb: [50, inf) = 5 "patch"
  replace zc: [50, inf) = 7 "patch"

version a3
  cite s
  governs 2026-01..2026-12
  known 2026-03-01
  zc: [0, 50) = 1 "late base"
  zc: [50, inf) = 2 "late base"
=== expect a_whole_alone
refused: LOAD-REPLACE replace rows of zc in a2 patch no table on 2026-01-01..2026-12-31 (m.tally:36)
